# Dack Fayden's emblem: "those permanents" are what the spell targeted as it was cast (CR 115.7: a later change of targets is
# a separate event and changes none of them). Bot1's -6 gives the emblem, then All That Glitters is cast on Bot2's Guerrilla
# Gorilla; the emblem's ability goes on the stack and Bot2 answers with Bolt Bend (Black Lotus and Mox Ruby pay its full
# cost), changing the Aura spell's target to Memnite. Bot1 still gains control of the Gorilla; the Memnite stays Bot2's, and
# the Aura enters on it, since that is the spell's target now.

